The BBRv3 sender in this repository (internal/congestion/bbr3_sender.go inside
bbr3-quic-go.patch) is a port of Google's BBRv3 for Linux, net/ipv4/tcp_bbr3.c on
branch bbr-v3-2026-09-16-01 of https://github.com/google/bbr, which is licensed
"GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause". This port is offered under the BSD-3-Clause option so that it
can sit next to quic-go (MIT). The test harness and data are under the same terms.

